  "atomic_questions": [
    "Since the objective is to minimize total distance but the time windows are in minutes, how should travel time be computed from the coordinates — should I use Euclidean distance with a constant speed of 1 unit per minute (so travel time equals Euclidean distance), or do you have a different speed or a distance matrix in mind?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy decision regarding the method for computing travel time (Euclidean with speed 1 vs. other speed/matrix), which constitutes one independent clarification question."
}

